vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式开源安全审查工具Codex Security，支持外部Agent调用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta推出Muse Code AI代理，支持大型代码库端到端软件工程任务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google拟斥资超15亿美元收购Mechanize以强化AI编程技术布局</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软披露财报显示 OpenAI 贡献 241 亿美元营收，占其 AI 业务七成份额</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软最新监管文件披露，在截至 2026 年 6 月的财年中，微软从 OpenAI 录得营收达 241 亿美元，约占其 AI 业务总营收的 70%。该金额涵盖了 OpenAI 支付的算力费用、模型构建成本及营收分成。尽管微软通过投资 Anthropic 及自研模型试图降低依赖，但 OpenAI 仍是其 AI 增长的最大贡献者。此前微软 CEO 纳德拉曾透露，截至 3 月季度末公司 AI 业务年化营收运行速率约为 370 亿美元。分析师指出，目前尚无法拆解 241 亿美元中云计算服务与财务安排的具体占比。此次数据披露正值 OpenAI 筹备 IPO 之际，市场对双方合作结构的透明度与单一依赖风险表现出高度关注，受此影响微软股价盘中微跌 0.5%。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动发布原生音视频全双工大模型SeedRealtime</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/322294f33be68d3d0c10e184cd8905a0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动近日正式发布原生音视频全双工大模型SeedRealtime，该模型采用统一架构，原生融合音频、视频与文本，支持在连续多模态信息流上实现实时交互，为用户提供“边看、边听、边说”的交互体验。此次发布标志着字节跳动在大模型全模态自然交互领域取得重要进展。随着DeepSeek、字节Seedance、MiniMax及月之暗面等国产大模型企业密集进行技术迭代，国产模型在视频生成、全模态交互及参数规模上均实现显著突破。行业分析指出，国产大模型竞争力的提升正加速推动应用向企业生产流程渗透，进而带动国产算力产业链景气度持续强化。目前，受益链条已从GPU扩展至CPU、AI服务器、存储、交换机、光模块、PCB、液冷、数据中心及电力基础设施等全产业链环节。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式开源安全审查工具Codex Security，支持外部Agent调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/71193de35e82f8b642dbd82dd58f1caf.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式将内部代号为Aardvark的安全审查工具开源，并命名为Codex Security，旨在解决Vibe Coding模式下产品安全盲区问题。该工具由大模型驱动，具备深入代码仓库自主阅读、漏洞识别、风险验证及提供修复方案的能力。在接入方式上，开发者可通过Codex授权登录、OpenAI API Key调用，或通过OpenRouter接入DeepSeek等第三方模型进行审查，以满足差异化的成本与性能需求。Codex Security的开源标志着原本封闭的Codex生态安全能力正式走向开放，允许各类外部Agent直接调用。尽管该工具能显著提升代码层面的安全性，但专家提醒，开发者仍需针对后端维护、CDN防护及DDoS攻击等复杂网络安全挑战保持定期审查习惯，以规避潜在的漏洞或接口权限风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta推出Muse Code AI代理，支持大型代码库端到端软件工程任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24d89f46d98eebd61dd14a8254fff6bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布AI编程代理Muse Code，旨在处理大型代码库开发场景，支持从任务规划、代码编写到结果验证的完整软件工程流程。该工具基于Meta编码模型Muse Spark，采用多代理协作机制，当面对大规模任务时，系统会自动拆分任务并由多个子代理在独立工作树中并行执行，有效避免代码冲突。在测试中，Muse Code曾成功同时为游戏开发六项功能。Meta首席执行官马克·扎克伯格表示，该工具已进入测试阶段，旨在通过多代理架构和高性价比优势，在AI编程代理市场与OpenAI的Codex及Anthropic的Claude Code展开竞争。此次发布标志着Meta进一步加码企业级AI代理市场，推动软件开发自动化从辅助工具向自主执行复杂任务演进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google拟斥资超15亿美元收购Mechanize以强化AI编程技术布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f58bf6d430c1f9a77228c4b71ce645c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google正与初创公司Mechanize商讨一项价值超15亿美元的交易，旨在通过人才引进与技术许可方式，补强其在AI编程领域的短板。Mechanize由Epoch AI联合创始人Tamay Besiroglu创立，其核心技术专注于提升AI模型的编码性能，此前曾获Nat Friedman等知名投资人支持。此次交易采取“收购式招聘加技术授权”的混合模式，旨在规避反垄断审查的同时，快速吸纳关键人才并获取非独家技术许可。面对OpenAI的Codex与Anthropic的Claude Code在开发者市场的先发优势，Google希望通过引入Mechanize的技术与团队，提升模型评估与开发能力。Mechanize长期愿景是实现高价值工作的全面自动化，若交易达成，将显著增强Google在AI编程赛道的竞争筹码，加剧与行业</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
